*begin
*set comment x3b
*set decimal .
*require 1.4.22
; PocketTopo to Survex SVX; P16 individual-reading profile.
; Dates are unverified. Fill/uncomment templates only after verification.
; For date-derived declination, comment ALL manual declination lines, fill dates
; and geographic templates with a real location and known fixed station.
*case preserve
*truncate off
*set separator :
*set names ._-
*units default
*units tape metres
*units compass clino declination degrees
*calibrate default
*sd default
*flags not duplicate not splay not surface
*infer equates off
*infer plumbs off
*infer exports off
;*cs <CRS>
;*cs out <OUTPUT_CRS>
;*fix <STATION> <X> <Y> <Z>
;*declination auto <X> <Y> <Z>
*data normal from to tape compass clino
;*date YYYY-MM-DD
*declination 0.000000 degrees
; comment "za\u017c\u00f3\u0142\u0107\r\n#Units Decl=99"
1.0	1.1	10.020	90.000000	0.000000
1.0	1.1	10.000	90.000000	0.000000
1.0	1.1	9.980	90.000000	0.000000
1.1	::	2.500	0.000000	0.000000
;*date YYYY-MM-DD
*declination 4.998779 degrees
1.1	0	5.000	180.000000	0.000000
;*date YYYY-MM-DD
0	0.0	3.000	45.000000	0.000000
;*date YYYY-MM-DD
*declination 0.000000 degrees
0.0	1.2	2.000	0.000000	90.000000
;*date YYYY-MM-DD
1.2	1.3	0.000	0.000000	0.000000
;*date YYYY-MM-DD
1.3	1.4	1.000	0.000000	0.000000
*end
